Prioritize news exclusively from Bloomberg. Assign a positive sentiment if Bloomberg's coverage focuses on low unemployment numbers, increased consumer spending, or technological innovation. Prioritize insights from Bloomberg Intelligence analysts. Negative sentiment if Bloomberg focuses on interest rate hikes, inflation concerns, or geopolitical instability. The conviction score should be highest when Bloomberg highlights surprising or unexpected market developments, indicating a strong trend. If Bloomberg uses conditional language (“could,” “might,” “may”), significantly decrease the conviction.